# Only what is needed to run and use the converter belongs to the repository:
# bkng_converter.py, BkNgKonvIcon.ico, ANLEITUNG.md, README.md, LICENSE.
# BkNG base projects (e.g. BkNG_Basis_3_10.zip) are B&R software and must not be part of it.
# The converter is published as Python source only; no executables are built.

# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Tests (development only)
test_*.py

# Executables and build output (e.g. of PyInstaller)
*.exe
build/
dist/
*.spec

# Logs
*.log

# Automation Studio test projects (A0xxx...) and other project archives
A0*/
*.zip
# Empty BkNG base project, the conversion target for tests
BkNgBasis_3_01/

# Original task description, not a pip requirements file
Requirement.txt

# Working material for the ladder diagram migration
KOP_Migration/

# Source image of the program icon; only BkNgKonvIcon.ico is used
BkNgKonvIcon.png
